# Root-level documentation of the shared env surface.
# Nothing is loaded from this file — each stack reads its own:
#   apps/mobile/.env   (public EXPO_PUBLIC_* values only)
#   backend/.env       (every secret; never committed)
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shared between both stacks (same value, different privilege level)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPABASE_URL           -> app reads as EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# App-side ONLY (public, shipped in the bundle, protected by RLS)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_MODE            mock | local | staging | production
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Backend ONLY (secret — never reaches the client). See backend/.env.example.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
# SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET
# DATABASE_URL
